║                                                                              ║
║                        🎯 3D FPS MOBILE GAME 🎯                              ║
║                                                                              ║
║  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ ║
║  │  Platform:  Android & iOS                                             │ ║
║  │  Engine:    Three.js + WebGL                                          │ ║
║  │  Framework: React Native + Expo                                       │ ║
║  │  Language:  TypeScript                                                │ ║
║  │  Version:   1.0.0                                                     │ ║
║  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ ║
║                                                                              ║
║  ✨ FEATURES:                                                                ║
║     • Realistic 3D Graphics with Dynamic Lighting                           ║
║     • Immersive First-Person Shooter Mechanics                              ║
║     • Touch-Optimized Controls (Joystick + Swipe + Fire)                    ║
║     • 7 Strategic Targets with Precision Hit Detection                      ║
║     • Professional HUD (Score, Ammo, Health, Crosshair)                     ║
║     • Smooth Performance on Mobile Devices                                  ║
║                                                                              ║
║  🚀 QUICK START:                                                             ║
║     1. npm start                                                             ║
║     2. Install Expo Go on your phone                                         ║
║     3. Scan QR code and play!                                                ║
║                                                                              ║
║  📚 DOCUMENTATION:                                                           ║
║     • README.md         - Complete documentation                             ║
║     • QUICK_START.md    - Fast setup guide                                   ║
║     • GAME_DESIGN.md    - Design document                                    ║
║     • FEATURES.md       - Features list                                      ║
║     • PROJECT_SUMMARY.md - Project overview                                  ║
║                                                                              ║
║  🎮 CONTROLS:                                                                ║
║     • Left Joystick  → Move                                                  ║
║     • Right Swipe    → Look Around                                           ║
║     • Fire Button    → Shoot                                                 ║
║                                                                              ║
║  🎯 OBJECTIVE:                                                               ║
║     Hit all 7 targets to complete the mission!                               ║
║     Each target = 100 points | Total ammo = 30 rounds                        ║
